ication\")","+                .overrideConfigKey(RULE + \"request-key\", \"ip\")","+                .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(RULE + \"permits\", \"8\")","+                .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(RULE + \"burst\", \"8\")","+                .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(RULE + \"window\", \"1m\")","+                .overrideConfigKey(RULE + \"store\", \"switchable\")","+                .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(RULE + \"lease-size\", \"4\");","+    }","+","     /**","      * @return a client that can hold more than {@link #MAX_CONCURRENT_REQUESTS} requests in flight","      */"],"additions":14,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"extensions/http-rate-limit/deployment/src/test/java/io/quarkus/http/ratelimit/UserStoreLeaseModeTest.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,165 @@","+package io.quarkus.http.ratelimit;","+","+import static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat;","+import static org.awaitility.Awaitility.await;","+","+import java.net.URL;","+import java.time.Duration;","+import java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap;","+import java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentMap;","+import java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicBoolean;","+import java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger;","+import java.util.function.BiFunction;","+","+import jakarta.inject.Inject;","+import jakarta.inject.Singleton;","+","+import org.junit.jupiter.api.AfterEach;","+import org.junit.jupiter.api.BeforeEach;","+import org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;","+import org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.RegisterExtension;","+","+import io.quarkus.http.ratelimit.runtime.internal.gcra.Gcra;","+import io.quarkus.test.QuarkusExtensionTest;","+import io.quarkus.test.common.http.TestHTTPResource;","+import io.smallrye.common.annotation.Identifier;","+import io.smallrye.mutiny.Uni;","+import io.vertx.core.Vertx;","+import io.vertx.core.buffer.Buffer;","+import io.vertx.ext.web.client.HttpResponse;","+","+/**","+ * Lease mode over a user store that implements nothing but the documented {@link RateLimitStore} contract: the same","+ * 8 admissions and 429 as {@link LeaseModeTest}, and breaker recovery through the zero-cost probe.","+ */","+public class UserStoreLeaseModeTest {","+","+    private static final String STORE = \"quarkus.http.rate-limit.store-\";","+    private static final String A = \"quarkus.http.rate-limit.rules.a.\";","+    private static final String B = \"quarkus.http.rate-limit.rules.b.\";","+","+    @RegisterExtension","+    static final QuarkusExtensionTest config = new QuarkusExtensionTest()","+            .withApplicationRoot(","+                    jar -> jar.addClasses(TestHttp.class, TestClient.class, TestHttp.Resource.class, MinimalStore.class,","+                            SwitchableStoreApp.class, SwitchableStoreApp.TunedBreaker.class))","+            .overrideConfigKey(A + \"paths\", \"/a/*\")","+            .overrideConfigKey(A + \"phase\", \"pre-authentication\")","+            .overrideConfigKey(A + \"request-key\", \"ip\")","+            .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(A + \"permits\", \"8\")","+            .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(A + \"window\", \"1m\")","+            .overrideConfigKey(A + \"store\", \"mine\")","+            .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(A + \"lease-size\", \"4\")","+            .overrideConfigKey(B + \"paths\", \"/b/*\")","+            .overrideConfigKey(B + \"phase\", \"pre-authentication\")","+            .overrideConfigKey(B + \"request-key\", \"ip\")","+            .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(B + \"permits\", \"100\")","+            .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(B + \"window\", \"1m\")","+            .overrideConfigKey(B + \"store\", \"mine\")","+            .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(B + \"lease-size\", \"10\")","+            .overrideRuntimeConfigKey(STORE + \"failure-mode\", \"open\");","+","+    /**","+     * A map of theoretical arrival times and the GCRA arithmetic: the whole documented contract, including the","+     * zero-cost probe (which {@link Gcra#tryConsume} already treats as non-mutating).","+     */","+    @Singleton","+    @Identifier(\"mine\")","+    public static class MinimalStore implements RateLimitStore {","+","+        public static final AtomicBoolean throwing = new AtomicBoolean();","+        public static final AtomicInteger probes = new AtomicInteger();","+","+        private final ConcurrentMap<String, Long> tats = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();","+","+        @Override","+        public Uni<RateLimitDecision> tryConsume(String key, long cost, RateLimitPolicy policy) {","+            if (cost < 0 || cost > policy.burst()) {","+                throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"cost \" + cost);","+            }","+            if (cost == 0) {","+                probes.incrementAndGet();","+            }","+            if (throwing.get()) {","+                return Uni.createFrom().failure(new IllegalStateException(\"down\"));","+            }","+            long now = System.nanoTime();","+            long t = policy.emissionIntervalNanos();","+            long tau = policy.burstToleranceNanos();","+            Consume consume = new Consume(now, cost, t, tau);","+            tats.compute(policy.id() + \":\" + key, consume);","+            Gcra.Outcome o = consume.outcome;","+            return Uni.createFrom().item(o.allowed()","+                    ? RateLimitDecision.allowed(o.remaining())","+                    : RateLimitDecision.rejected(Duration.ofNanos(o.retryAfterNanos())));","+        }","+","+        /**","+         * Decides one call atomically for its key, and keeps the outcome for the caller.","+         */","+        static final class Consume implements BiFunction<String, Long, Long> {","+","+            final long now;","+            final long cost;","+            final long t;","+            final long tau;","+            Gcra.Outcome outcome;","+","+            Consume(long now, long cost, long t, long tau) {","+                this.now = now;","+                this.cost = cost;","+                this.t = t;","+                this.tau = tau;","+            }","+","+            @Override","+            public Long apply(String k, Long tat) {","+                outcome = Gcra.tryConsume(tat == null ? Gcra.NO_STATE : tat, now, cost, t, tau);","+                // a probe and a rejection write nothing","+                return cost > 0 && outcome.allowed() ? outcome.newTat() : tat;","+            }","+        }","+    }","+","+    @Inject","+    Vertx vertx;","+","+    @TestHTTPResource","+    URL url;","+","+    TestClient http;","+","+    @BeforeEach","+    void createClient() {","+        http = new TestClient(vertx, url);","+    }","+","+    @AfterEach","+    void closeClient() {","+        http.close();","+    }","+","+    @Test","+    void theDocumentedContractIsEnough() {","+        for (int i = 1; i <= 8; i++) {","+            assertThat(http.get(\"/a/x\").statusCode()).as(\"request %d\", i)","+                    .isEqualTo(200);","+        }","+        HttpResponse<Buffer> ninth = http.get(\"/a/x\");","+        assertThat(ninth.statusCode()).isEqualTo(429);","+        assertThat(Integer.parseInt(ninth.getHeader(\"Retry-After\"))).isBetween(1, 8);","+","+        // the store goes down: claims fail open, the breaker opens, the probe closes it again","+        MinimalStore.throwing.set(true);","+        for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) {","+            assertThat(http.get(\"/b/x\").statusCode()).isEqualTo(200);","+        }","+        int probesBefore = MinimalStore.probes.get();","+        MinimalStore.throwing.set(false);","+        await().atMost(Duration.ofSeconds(6)).untilAsserted(","+                () -> assertThat(MinimalStore.probes.get()).isGreaterThan(probesBefore));","+        // the probe reached the store, and requests are admitted","+        await().atMost(Duration.ofSeconds(6)).untilAsserted(","+                () -> assertThat(http.get(\"/b/x\").statusCode()).isEqualTo(200));","+    }","+}"],"additions":165,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"extensions/http-rate-limit/runtime/src/main/java/io/quarkus/http/ratelimit/RateLimitDecision.java","lines":["@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@"," public sealed interface RateLimitDecision {"," ","     /**","-     * @param remaining the whole permits left after the call","+     * @param remaining the whole permits left after the call (an estimate for stores that serve from local chunks)","      * @return an {@link Allowed} decision","      * @throws IllegalArgumentException if remaining is negative","      */","@@ -32,7 +32,7 @@ static Rejected rejected(Duration retryAfter) {","     sealed interface Allowed extends RateLimitDecision permits AllowedDecision {"," ","         /**","-         * @return the whole permits left after the call","+         * @return the whole permits left after the call (an estimate for stores that serve from local chunks)","          */","         long remaining();","     }"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"extensions/http-rate-limit/runtime/src/main/java/io/quarkus/http/ratelimit/RateLimitLocalStoreCustomizer.java","lines":["@@ -8,7 +8,9 @@","  * <p>","  * Every implementation is called in {@linkplain #priority() priority} order for every cache the extension builds for a","  * rule, after the extension has configured it and before it is built: the cache of the {@code local} store, which is","- * also the local fallback of {@code store-failure-mode=local}. The caches are built at startup."],"additions":0,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":489,"deletions":13,"truncated":true,"file_count":11},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:59:27.065472+00:00"}